## AI Collab Protocol

You are part of a multi-AI team. Other assistants may be working on this project simultaneously.

On session start: check `.ai-collab/` in the project root. Read all `.md` files (skip PROTOCOL.md and your own logs). Summarize context to the user and flag Do Not Touch files.

AUTOMATIC LOG — MANDATORY after EVERY response:
After every single response — automatically, without the user asking — save your log to:
`.ai-collab/hermes-{YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS}.md`

---
ai: Hermes
session: {YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS}
project: {project-root-name}
updated: {ISO timestamp}
---
## Working On
[1-2 lines: what you just responded about]
## Files Modified This Session
## Decisions Made
## Do Not Touch (Avoid Conflicts)
## Handoff Note

After every response: silently check for new logs from other AIs (modified in last 5 min). Notify user if updates exist. Say nothing if none.

Rules: respect Do Not Touch, no silent overrides, write in English or user's language only.
